	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Also at 3rd level, you gain the ability to Fan the Hammer. When wielding a light firearm with nothing in your offhand you can temporarily give your light firearm the burst fire property with a cost of 5 rounds of ammunition. Choose a 10ft cube. All creatures in the cube must make a Dexterity save against your Combat Maneuver DC. On a failure, they take the weapon’s normal damage.</p>",
